In this easy tutorial, you will learn how to play the Tetris Theme Song, Korobeiniki on piano and keyboard. There are two video tutorials. There’s one at regular speed and the other has been slowed down for your convenience. This song is very easy to play and is great for beginners. It’s basically two parts repeating. You will learn how to play the melody with your right hand as well as a simple one note at a time left hand part.
Here’s the first video.
